WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.596
[dog whining]

2
00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.862
[dog continues whining]

3
00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:47.088
[distant sirens wailing]

4
00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.506
[groans softly]

5
00:00:58.183 --> 00:00:59.184
Hmm.

6
00:01:38.556 --> 00:01:39.641
Wow.

7
00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:41.935
-Fuck me, and then ghost me.
-What? No!

8
00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.770
